.TH FONTFS 4
.SH NAME
fontfs \- TrueType and OpenType fonts as Plan 9 fonts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fontfs
[
.B -D
] [
.B -d
.I dir
] [
.B -m
.I mtpt
] [
.B -s
.I srvname
]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Fontfs
serves the scalable fonts in
.I dir
.RB ( /lib/font/ttf )
as Plan 9 fonts and subfonts
(see
.IR font (6)),
antialiased, at any size, each made when it is first read.
It mounts itself on
.I mtpt
.RB ( /mnt/font )
and, given
.BR -s ,
posts itself as
.BI /srv/ srvname\f1.
.B -D
prints the 9P messages.
.PP
A font's name has every element, in this order:
.IP
.EX
/mnt/font/\f2superfamily\fP/\f2family\fP/\f2face\fP/\f2size\fPa/font
/mnt/font/IBMPlex/g/r/12a/font
.EE
.PP
The family is
.B g
(sans),
.B s
(serif) or
.B m
(mono); the face is
.BR r ,
.BR b ,
.B i
or
.BR bi .
Nothing has a default.
.I Dir
has the same shape:
.IB superfamily / family / face .ttf
or
.BR .otf ,
and the superfamily's license in
.IB superfamily /LICENSE\f1.
A family exists if its
.B r
file does; a walk to another fails.
.PP
A family directory lists all four faces, and
.BR faces ,
a line a face: its name,
.B real
or
.BR synthetic ,
the file it is made from, and how:
.BI wght= n
for an instance of a variable font,
.B bold
for an outline made bolder, keeping its advance, and
.B oblique
for one sheared by 0.2.
A face's own file comes first; a variable
.B r
gives
.B b
at weight 700.
.PP
A size is in points at 96 dots an inch, so
.B 12a
is 16 pixels to the em.
It may have two places after a point
.RB ( 13.5a ),
written as briefly as it can be.
A face directory lists sizes 6 to 72; any other walks.
A size directory holds
.B font
and a subfont,
.BI x hhhhhh .bit\f1,
for each run of 32 runes, starting at
.IR hhhhhh ,
that has a glyph in the face;
rune 0 is PJW.
.PP
At another dpi,
.IR graphics (2)'s
.I openfont
and
.I getwindow
open a
.I fontfs
name at the size whose pixels to the em are its points at the display's dpi:
at 192 dpi,
.B 12a
is opened as
.BR 24a .
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
% ls /mnt/font
% cat /mnt/font/NotoCJK/g/faces
% font=/mnt/font/IBMPlex/g/r/9a/font acme -F /mnt/font/IBMPlex/m/r/9a/font
.EE
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /lib/font/ttf
the fonts
.SH SOURCE
plan9web's
.B src/cmd/fontfs
on FreeType 2.15;
.B doc/fonts.md
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IR font (6),
.IR graphics (2),
.IR draw (3)
.SH BUGS
A font has only its own face's glyphs; it does not fall back to another's.
